<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Construct heavy weapons that offer superior firepower, at the cost of being very physically demanding.-->
  <VWE_HeavyWeapons.description>建造能够提供强大火力的重型武器，但代价是对体力的要求很高。</VWE_HeavyWeapons.description>
  <VWE_HeavyWeapons.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the weight of power-->
    <li>subject-&gt;权力的重量</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed weapons that bring unparalleled firepower to the battlefield-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发的武器可为战场带来无与伦比的火力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->balanced the scales of warfare with heavy, decisive armaments-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用重型、决定性的武器平衡战争规模</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created training programs for specialized units to operate these weapons-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为特种部队制定了操作这些武器的培训计划</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered mobility solutions to transport and deploy heavy armaments-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用于运输和部署重型武器的工程移动解决方案</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->mastering the art of destruction with heavy weapons-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;掌握重型武器的破坏艺术</li>
  </VWE_HeavyWeapons.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: heavy weapons-->
  <VWE_HeavyWeapons.label>重型武器</VWE_HeavyWeapons.label>
  <!--EN: Adapt laser targeting systems for accurate and swift delivery of charged payloads.-->
  <VWE_LaserTargetingSystems.description>采用激光瞄准系统，准确、快速地输送带电有效载荷。</VWE_LaserTargetingSystems.description>
  <VWE_LaserTargetingSystems.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->pinpoint accuracy-->
    <li>subject-&gt;精确度</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->revolutionized precision strikes with advanced laser guidance-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;通过先进的激光制导实现革命性的精确打击</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->enabled real-time target acquisition and adjustment-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;启用实时目标获取和调整</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->integrated systems with existing weaponry for enhanced combat effectiveness-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;与现有武器的集成系统可增强战斗力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed compact, portable laser designators for field operations-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发了用于现场操作的紧凑型便携式激光指示器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->honing the edge of warfare with technology-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;利用技术磨练战争优势</li>
  </VWE_LaserTargetingSystems.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: laser targeting systems-->
  <VWE_LaserTargetingSystems.label>激光瞄准系统</VWE_LaserTargetingSystems.label>
  <!--EN: Adapt a trench warfare doctrine with a selection of weapons for close-quarters combat.-->
  <VWE_TrenchWarfare.description>采用一系列近距离作战武器来适应堑壕战理论。</VWE_TrenchWarfare.description>
  <VWE_TrenchWarfare.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->entrenched defense-->
    <li>subject-&gt;根深蒂固的防御</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->adopted age-old strategies to modern combat, ensuring survival-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在现代战斗中采用了古老的策略，确保生存</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated in close-quarters battle tactics within the trenches-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;战壕内近距离战斗战术的创新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered fortifications that blend with the landscape for surprise attacks-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心设计的防御工事与地形融为一体，可进行突然袭击</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed communication lines within trenches to coordinate assaults-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发战壕内的通信线路以协调攻击</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->fortifying positions with strategic ingenuity in warfare-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;在战争中以战略独创性强化阵地</li>
  </VWE_TrenchWarfare.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: trench warfare-->
  <VWE_TrenchWarfare.label>堑壕战</VWE_TrenchWarfare.label>
</LanguageData>
